      "writtenOn": "2020-03-23T13:57:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the context of apks, the term package refers to the name in AndroidManifest.xml that uniquely identifies an apk. So calling this a package name seems wrong to me. This is just a \u0027module name\u0027.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 467,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 467,
        "endChar": 31
      },
      "revId": "f6f8c16461e74d4094af66aa90496b0badcd282c",
