      "writtenOn": "2020-03-23T15:07:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, installApkName sounds good. I think AndroidAppImport should use that name too instead of BaseModuleName(). I guess that\u0027s a bug. Adding Jaewoong for confirmation.",
